ts-content" class="toc"><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="0"><a style="--toc-padding-left:0rem" href="#what-can-scenario-builder-do-" class="break-words py-1 block pl-[calc(var(--toc-padding-left)+var(--toc-focus-padding,0rem))] focus-visible:[--toc-focus-padding:0.25rem] focus-visible:-ml-1 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 dark:text-gray-400 [li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-900 dark:[li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-300 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary-light [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:[text-shadow:-0.15px_0_0_currentColor,0.15px_0_0_currentColor]">What can Scenario Builder do ?</a></li><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="0"><a style="--toc-padding-left:0rem" href="#what-type-of-research-can-scenario-builder-be-used-for" class="break-words py-1 block pl-[calc(var(--toc-padding-left)+var(--toc-focus-padding,0rem))] focus-visible:[--toc-focus-padding:0.25rem] focus-visible:-ml-1 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 dark:text-gray-400 [li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-900 dark:[li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-300 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary-light [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:[text-shadow:-0.15px_0_0_currentColor,0.15px_0_0_currentColor]">What type of research can Scenario Builder be used for?</a></li></ul></div></nav></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative grow box-border flex-col w-full mx-auto px-1 lg:pl-[5.7rem] lg:-ml-12 xl:w-[calc(100%-28rem)]" id="content-area"><header id="header" class="relative leading-none @container/page-header"><div class="mt-0.5 space-y-2.5"><div class="eyebrow h-5 text-primary dark:text-primary-light text-sm font-semibold">Platform</div><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center relative gap-2 min-w-0"><h1 id="page-title" class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-gray-900 tracking-tight dark:text-gray-200 [overflow-wrap:anywhere] font-semibold">What is Scenario Builder?</h1></div></div><div class="mt-2 text-lg prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert [&amp;&gt;*]:[overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><p>A brief introduction to Scenario Builder, our free, no-code energy system modelling platform for the power sector.</p></div></header><div class="mdx-content @container/columns-container relative mt-8 prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert [contain:inline-size] isolate empty:hidden mb-14" data-page-title="What is Scenario Builder?" data-page-href="/platform/scenario-builder" id="content"><span data-as="p">Scenario Builder is a no-code modelling tool for power system analysts and modellers. It lets users build, run, and analyse results from long-term capacity expansion and hourly dispatch models quickly, transparently, and at scale. Designed for analysts and modellers working at or alongside governments, it simplifies the modelling process while maintaining analytical depth.</span>
<div><div data-name="frame" class="frame p-2 not-prose relative bg-gray-50/50 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden dark:bg-gray-800/25 print:print-color-exact"><div style="background-position:10px 10px" class="absolute inset-0 bg-grid-neutral-200/20 [mask-image:linear-gradient(0deg,#fff,rgba(255,255,255,0.6))] dark:bg-grid-white/5 dark:[mask-image:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.1),rgba(255,255,255,0.5))] print:print-color-exact"></div><div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden flex justify-center [&amp;_:where(img:not([class*=rounded-]))]:rounded-xl"><span data-ramka-trigger="" class="zoom-image-trigger contents cursor-zoom-in"><span class="contents"><picture class="contents"><img data-path="images/SB3.0-Inputs-1.png" src="https://mintcdn.com/transitionzero/HSEawz0vTgacZg8o/images/SB3.0-Inputs-1.png?fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;n=HSEawz0vTgacZg8o&amp;q=85&amp;s=df4c14a3ad96e8197486ab09782ab723" alt="SB3 0 Inputs 1" class="object-contain" width="1408" height="880" decoding="async" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" srcSet="https://mintcdn.com/transitionzero/HSEawz0vTgacZg8o/images/SB3.0-Inputs-1.png?w=280&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;n=HSEawz0vTgacZg8o&amp;q=85&amp;s=9e6d613ca025873d9bdd7c13e4493bdd 280w, https://mintcdn.com/transitionzero/HSEawz0vTgacZg8o/images/SB3.0-Inputs-1.png?w=560&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;n=HSEawz0vTgacZg8o&amp;q=85&amp;s=f668da11ad0c15141e4f8202d3ba449d 560w, https://mintcdn.com/transitionzero/HSEawz0vTgacZg8o/images/SB3.0-Inputs-1.png?w=840&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;n=HSEawz0vTgacZg8o&amp;q=85&amp;s=99fd4c131a38146dd193b75b416fc229 840w, https://mintcdn.com/transitionzero/HSEawz0vTgacZg8o/images/SB3.0-Inputs-1.png?w=1100&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;n=HSEawz0vTgacZg8o&amp;q=85&amp;s=9d18f77cff17cc37eacd96c140116d97 1100w, https://mintcdn.com/transitionzero/HSEawz0vTgacZg8o/images/SB3.0-Inputs-1.png?w=1650&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;n=HSEawz0vTgacZg8o&amp;q=85&amp;s=76dfd41f42ccd6d212a5af3744440eea 1650w, ht